From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MI50 ROCm 10.x project <mi50-rocm10@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] hipBLASLt: allow explicit gfx906 forward-port builds

The ROCm 10 hipBLASLt target policy excludes gfx906 before code generation.
Register gfx906 as an explicit target so the MI50 compatibility build can
exercise the generic path and fail at a concrete missing-kernel boundary
instead of failing target validation. Keep gfx906 out of the default `all`
list; rocBLAS remains the production fallback until this path is validated.

---
 projects/hipblaslt/cmake/tensilelite_supported_architectures.cmake | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/projects/hipblaslt/cmake/tensilelite_supported_architectures.cmake b/projects/hipblaslt/cmake/tensilelite_supported_architectures.cmake
index 0000000..1111111 100644
--- a/projects/hipblaslt/cmake/tensilelite_supported_architectures.cmake
+++ b/projects/hipblaslt/cmake/tensilelite_supported_architectures.cmake
@@ -4,5 +4,6 @@
 # All supported architectures including xnack variants - used for validation of GPU_TARGETS
 set(SUPPORTED_ARCHITECTURES
+    "gfx906"
     "gfx908"
     "gfx90a"
     "gfx942"
--
2.45.2
